# Other Notes
Other updates, such as through your distribution's repos or our official Flatpak, will occur shortly, but will proably span over the next few days as we all perform testing. Our official Flatpak will also be updated to use the latest runtime and dependencies.

There should be one last 1.3.x release if one comes, that being version 1.3.6. This will contain minimal but otherwise more important updates. After that release, we plan to no longer make releases for 1.3.x unless deemed necessary (e.g., because of a security vulnerability).</releaseNotes>
